<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title>Hindi Typing Tutor</title><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><style>body{background:#070c18;color:#f8fafc;font-family:sans-serif;padding:20px;text-align:center}.box{max-width:560px;margin:auto;background:#0f172a;padding:24px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid #1e293b}.drill{font-size:1.3rem;background:#131d35;padding:14px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:12px;color:#38bdf8}input{width:100%;padding:12px;background:#070c18;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:8px;color:#fff;font-size:1.1rem;box-sizing:border-box}</style></head><body><div class="box"><h3>⌨️ Remington Gail & Inscript Hindi Tutor</h3><div class="drill">क ख ग घ ङ | च छ ज झ ञ</div><input type="text" placeholder="अभ्यास यहाँ टाइप करें..."></div></body></html>